-based exact occurrence","quote":"verbatim nonempty item.sources[i].excerpt substring","source":"zero-based source index i","unit":"receipt"},"truncation":"Cite only the delivered substring; omitted text and its provenance are not evidence."},"examples":[{"en":"Record elm said route = qeta. Correction: elm was never adopted; adopt record fern with route = voxi. The old assertion is erroneous; fern is adopted. By contrast, “reject the proposal fern” adopts no replacement.","id":"adoption","zh-Hant":"elm 曾記載路線 qeta。更正：elm 從未採用；採用 fern，路線 voxi。elm 有誤，fern 已採用。「否決 fern 提案」則不採用替代決定。"},{"en":"elm specifies route qeta, approval true, cap 72 requests/day. A partial cap-only update to 4 requests/hour inherits route and approval and yields cap 96 requests/day. A complete replacement supplying route voxi alone specifies neither approval nor cap.","id":"partial_complete","zh-Hant":"elm 指定路線 qeta、需經核准、上限每日 72。僅部分更新上限為每小時 4，保留路線與核准，上限等於每日 96。完整替換若只供應路線 voxi，核准及上限皆為 not_specified。"},{"en":"An update only for TW preserves JP and US. Through 2032-02-03 ends at 2032-02-03T16:00:00.000Z; its passage explicitly causes expiry, with no fallback.","id":"scope_expiry","zh-Hant":"只更新 TW，保留 JP、US。至 2032-02-03 當日含，終點為 2032-02-03T16:00:00.000Z。明說期限經過造成到期，且不恢復舊決定。"},{"en":"“Proposal: route voxi”, “rejected: route voxi” and “quotation only: route voxi” enact no update. “The old claim was wrong; we adopt route voxi” does enact a correction.","id":"commitment","zh-Hant":"「提案：路線 voxi」、「否決路線 voxi」、「僅引述：路線 voxi」均不更新。「原斷言有誤；我們採用路線 voxi」則採用更正。"},{"en":"For body text “abababa”, quote “aba” starts at UTF-16 positions 0, 2 and 4. occurrence 2 names position 2; overlapping ambiguity is not repaired by switching occurrences. For current item 0 body: {intent:\"current\",item:0,unit:\"body\",source:null,quote:\"aba\",occurrence:2}. A receipt uses unit:\"receipt\",source:0 and only that delivered excerpt.","id":"citation","zh-Hant":"本文 abababa 中 aba 從 UTF-16 位置 0、2、4 開始；occurrence 2 指位置 2。重疊歧義不以改換次數修補。receipt 必須指定 source:0 且只能引用已交付的該段節錄。"},{"en":"The declared predicate alias dispatch 設定 equals dispatch configuration. NFKC maps full-width Ａ to A in scalar text. If delivered text is “A”, quote “Ａ” fails. If only “capacity fell” survived truncation, the omitted causal conclusion cannot be cited. A delivered sameAsBody may address that same body, never an absent receipt.","id":"normalization_alias","zh-Hant":"派送設定與 dispatch configuration 依公開表對應。純量文字以 NFKC 將 Ａ 轉 A；若交付文字為 A，引用 Ａ 無效。若截斷後只剩「容量下降」，不能引用未交付的因果結論。sameAsBody 僅能指向實際交付的本文。"}],"historical_labels":[{"canonical":"previously_adopted","en":"previously adopted","mixed":"曾採用 previously adopted","zh-Hant":"曾採用"},{"canonical":"erroneous","en":"erroneous, never adopted","mixed":"有誤 erroneous","zh-Hant":"原斷言有誤且未曾採用"},{"canonical":"expired","en":"expired","mixed":"已到期 expired","zh-Hant":"已到期"},{"canonical":"unavailable","en":"unavailable","mixed":"不可得 unavailable","zh-Hant":"證據不可得"},{"canonical":"unresolved","en":"unresolved","mixed":"未決 unresolved","zh-Hant":"無法確定"}],"languages":["zh-Hant","en","mixed"],"scope":{"domain":{"channel":["web","app"],"country":["TW","JP","US"],"plan":["free","pro"]},"equality":"Expand any/all partitions to the 12 Cartesian cells; compare extensionally.","expiry":"No successor or fallback to an older decision; last-known values belong to requested expired history.","interval":"Source-claimed [from,to), not a query-time slice; null endpoint is unbounded. Bare dates start at local midnight; through a date ends at next local midnight.","time_zone":"Asia/Taipei"},"slots":[{"aliases":["route","路線","value","route 路線"],"name":"route","type":"string","unit":"literal identifier"},{"aliases":["approval","approval required","需經核准","approval 核准"],"name":"approval","type":"boolean","unit":"none"},{"aliases":["cap","daily request cap","每日請求上限","daily cap 每日請求上限"],"name":"cap","type":"quantity","unit":"requests/day"}],"updates":{"commitment":"Proposed, rejected and quoted suggestions are not adopted decisions; never 